{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39167","headline":"闻官军继至未覩凯旋 · 韦庄","name":"闻官军继至未覩凯旋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嫖姚何日破重围，秋草深来战马肥。\n已有孔明传将略，更闻王导得神机。\n阵前鼙鼓晴应响，城上乌鸢饱不飞。\n何事小臣偏注目，帝乡遥羡白云归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}